Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.29,0:00:05.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,put on God's whole armor.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.59,0:00:07.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pray it with me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will put on each
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,piece of the armor,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.51,0:00:13.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,truth, peace, faith,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,and salvation,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and pray it over the conversations
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.13,0:00:20.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the work ahead of you today.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have your shoes beside
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,the door or breakfast still
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the table.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.30,0:00:28.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wherever this morning finds you,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.74,0:00:30.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring the day as it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have work to finish,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,someone to care for,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a difficult conversation ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you can,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.38,0:00:41.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your shoulders settle as you listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.64,0:00:43.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will pray through
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,the armor named in Ephesians,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking God to shape our thoughts,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.10,0:00:49.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,words, and actions.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can join quietly while you prepare.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.42,0:00:53.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.83,0:00:56.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,hear where our strength begins.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Finally, my brethren,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.74,0:01:00.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be strong in the Lord,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and in the power of his might.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.02,0:01:04.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,I come to you before I know
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything this day will require.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.33,0:01:12.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,You see the tasks already arranged
Dialogue: 4,0:01:12.08,0:01:13.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the interruptions I
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.94,0:01:15.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,cannot anticipate.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some mornings I feel ready;
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.38,0:01:20.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,this morning I bring whatever
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,strength I actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.84,0:01:24.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to depend
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,on you without hiding my limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me begin with a willing heart
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.67,0:01:32.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of waiting until I feel
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.06,0:01:34.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,impressive or completely prepared.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.98,0:01:37.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my plans before you,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.22,0:01:39.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking for wisdom to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,the good that is mine to do
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.76,0:01:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and humility to receive help
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,along the way.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Put on the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:48.63,0:01:50.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able to stand
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.62,0:01:53.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against the wiles of the devil.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.44,0:01:54.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.79,0:01:56.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,let this prayer reach
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond these quiet minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.49,0:02:01.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need truth when I answer questions,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.40,0:02:04.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,righteousness when nobody is watching,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.39,0:02:06.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,and peace when another
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.12,0:02:08.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,person tries my patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need faith when the way
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,ahead is unclear,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,the assurance of your salvation
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,when shame grows loud,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:15.83,0:02:18.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your Word when I must choose.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gather these requests
Dialogue: 4,0:02:20.40,0:02:23.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a life that belongs to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.26,0:02:25.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from treating prayer as
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,a morning task I finish and forget.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let dependence on you accompany
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.77,0:02:32.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,my first decision and remain
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,with me through the last.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For we wrestle not against
Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}flesh and blood,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.29,0:02:41.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but against principalities,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.51,0:02:42.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against powers,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.74,0:02:44.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against the rulers
Dialogue: 5,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the darkness of this world,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.07,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against spiritual
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.07,0:02:50.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wickedness in high places.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.81,0:02:52.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,God of mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.97,0:02:54.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard the way I look
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,at people today.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I disagree with someone,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me from reducing that person
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.15,0:03:03.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,to an obstacle or a threat.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:03.48,0:03:05.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me resist cruelty,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,deception,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.26,0:03:08.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and injustice without
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,cultivating hatred.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me discernment to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.41,0:03:14.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,harmful behavior and courage
Dialogue: 4,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to establish a needed boundary.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to protect what is good
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,while remembering the humanity
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,of those involved.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.43,0:03:26.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where anger has narrowed my vision,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,make room for wise counsel,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.43,0:03:29.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,fair questions,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the possibility
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,that I have more to learn.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.56,0:03:34.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.95,0:03:36.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,what standing firm looks
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.83,0:03:39.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,like in an ordinary day.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wherefore take unto
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.06,0:03:43.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}you the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to withstand in the evil day,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having done all, to stand.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.82,0:03:51.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.36,0:03:53.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,show me what standing faithfully
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.83,0:03:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,looks like in the circumstances
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I actually face.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.76,0:03:59.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may mean refusing
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.38,0:04:00.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,to repeat a rumor,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,admitting an error,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeping a promise,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,or leaving a conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.84,0:04:08.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has become harmful.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may mean doing patient
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.03,0:04:12.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,work that nobody will praise.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.59,0:04:14.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Free me from the need to make
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.78,0:04:17.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,every faithful act dramatic.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,When pressure comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.72,0:04:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me remember
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,what matters before I react.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.38,0:04:23.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the steadiness
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,to do what is right,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.45,0:04:28.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,even when the result arrives slowly
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the approval I hoped
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.77,0:04:31.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,for never comes.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.24,0:04:33.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Stand therefore,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.42,0:04:36.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}having your loins girt about with truth,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having on the breastplate
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness;
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.35,0:04:41.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,fasten truth around
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way I live today.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my words match what I know,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give me freedom to say
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I do not know.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I send a message,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.11,0:04:56.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me check whether it is accurate.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.11,0:04:58.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I explain myself,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:58.09,0:05:00.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice where I am
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,tempted to exaggerate.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender the wish
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.83,0:05:05.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,to appear more capable,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.64,0:05:06.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,more certain,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.66,0:05:09.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,or more innocent than I am.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.09,0:05:11.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make honesty a place where
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can stand securely,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.98,0:05:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,without constantly managing
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.22,0:05:17.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,an image or remembering which
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,version of a story I told.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The night is far spent,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.97,0:05:24.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the day is at hand:
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}let us therefore cast off
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the works of darkness,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and let us put
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.35,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}on the armour of light.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.60,0:05:32.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place before you the habit
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,that keeps drawing me away
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,from honesty and love.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not rename it
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.96,0:05:42.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,to make it harmless.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the moment
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.89,0:05:47.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I usually surrender to it:
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.51,0:05:48.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,the idle minute,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,the injured pride,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,the private screen,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.53,0:05:54.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the wish to escape discomfort.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to change
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can change around that moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me seek appropriate support
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.34,0:06:03.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of relying on secrecy.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.98,0:06:06.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this new morning become
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.05,0:06:09.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,an opportunity to turn toward the light
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.02,0:06:11.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,through one real and manageable
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,act of obedience.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace for every doorway
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.65,0:06:19.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will walk through today.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And your feet shod with the preparation
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the gospel of peace;
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,prepare my feet to carry peace
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the places I enter.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I step into the kitchen,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,the workplace, the classroom,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the waiting room,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.89,0:06:41.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice the people already there.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.07,0:06:44.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my arrival make room for kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Slow the sharp greeting
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.85,0:06:48.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,that comes from feeling rushed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive when somebody
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.58,0:06:53.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,speaks before I am ready to listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.51,0:06:56.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I move between responsibilities,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me that the person in front
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.80,0:07:01.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,of me is more than an interruption.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.79,0:07:04.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me a peaceful presence that can
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.76,0:07:07.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,coexist with necessary urgency.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.62,0:07:11.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow a quiet moment here.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.22,0:07:14.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring one person's name before
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,God without planning their
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.26,0:07:17.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,entire future.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold that person in prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for wisdom about
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,your own next act of care.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.96,0:07:30.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Above all,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.69,0:07:32.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}taking the shield of faith,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.66,0:07:35.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wherewith ye shall be able to quench
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all the fiery darts of the wicked.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.39,0:07:39.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift the shield of faith
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I face what I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,settle this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.70,0:07:48.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are answers I would like
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to have and outcomes I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.35,0:07:52.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,secure by thinking harder.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me trust your character while
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.94,0:07:57.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing the work that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.48,0:07:59.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,When an alarming thought arrives,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me room to examine
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.71,0:08:03.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,it before I obey it.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.52,0:08:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from treating every
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.65,0:08:08.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,possibility as a certainty.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let faith steady my attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.47,0:08:13.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,so I can respond to the situation
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,before me with wisdom rather than
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,surrendering the whole day to
Dialogue: 4,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,imagined trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.67,0:08:22.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For God hath not given
Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}us the spirit of fear;
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,but of power, and of love,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,and of a sound mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.02,0:08:30.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.33,0:08:32.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me receive courage
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a thoughtful mind and
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.19,0:08:35.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,a loving heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel afraid,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me bring that feeling
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you without shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:40.79,0:08:43.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me toward the information,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.52,0:08:44.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,preparation,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.55,0:08:47.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and support the situation requires.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.84,0:08:50.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me read the instructions,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask the useful question,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.88,0:08:55.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and allow enough time for the journey.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from confusing
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.65,0:08:59.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,confidence with carelessness.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need assistance,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.89,0:09:03.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me request it plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shape a courage that can
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,admit uncertainty,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,learn from others,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.10,0:09:09.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,and still take the next
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsible step in your presence.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, the helmet and the sword,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the thoughts that try
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.65,0:09:19.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,to tell you who you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And take the helmet of salvation,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the sword of the Spirit,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is the word of God:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.44,0:09:28.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.94,0:09:31.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,let the hope of your salvation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard my mind today.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I measure my value
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,by an achievement,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.91,0:09:37.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,a response,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,or another person's approval,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.19,0:09:43.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,turn my attention toward your grace.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.44,0:09:46.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you my need for forgiveness
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.31,0:09:48.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my desire to belong.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.58,0:09:51.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me live as someone learning
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive mercy and extend it.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I make a mistake,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me from calling
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,the whole day ruined.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I succeed,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me grateful.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my identity grow deeper
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.11,0:10:06.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,than the latest evaluation,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.31,0:10:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,held in the hope
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have in you.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.04,0:10:12.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Praying always with all prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication in the Spirit,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.61,0:10:16.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and watching thereunto with all
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}perseverance and supplication
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for all saints;
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.82,0:10:22.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.39,0:10:23.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,widen this prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond my own schedule.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.96,0:10:28.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those who begin
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.07,0:10:29.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,today carrying grief,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,those responsible
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.14,0:10:33.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,for difficult decisions,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,and those whose labor
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,is easily overlooked.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.78,0:10:39.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen believers who face hostility,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,loneliness, or discouragement.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.67,0:10:44.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give wisdom to the people
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,serving their communities
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.10,0:10:48.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,and caring for those in need.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.39,0:10:50.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring trustworthy support
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,to people who feel isolated.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me whether I can become
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of an answer through
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.52,0:10:58.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,a practical act of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me watchful for needs
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.43,0:11:02.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,that are close enough for me
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.55,0:11:05.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,to notice and respond to today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you go,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.39,0:11:09.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,hear the words of courage
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,God spoke to Joshua.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.52,0:11:13.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,They are for you too.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.23,0:11:16.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Have not I commanded thee?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Be strong and of a good courage;
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.67,0:11:20.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be not afraid,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.85,0:11:23.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither be thou dismayed:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.26,0:11:24.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD thy God
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.84,0:11:28.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is with thee whithersoever thou goest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.44,0:11:29.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I hear the words
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,you spoke to Joshua,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember that courage grows
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.35,0:11:37.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,through trust and obedience.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.91,0:11:39.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me in my own
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibilities today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.84,0:11:43.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I may need to make
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,a call I have avoided,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,begin work that feels beyond me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,or ask for help with a problem
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot solve alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.91,0:11:54.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me prepare carefully and move
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.45,0:11:56.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,without demanding complete
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.39,0:11:57.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,certainty first.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,When the task feels large,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.86,0:12:01.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring my attention
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.23,0:12:03.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the first honest step.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your presence matter more to me
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.81,0:12:08.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,than the appearance of being fearless.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.68,0:12:11.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}It is God that girdeth
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}me with strength,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.81,0:12:15.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and maketh my way perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.49,0:12:16.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,strengthen me for the work
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.87,0:12:20.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is truly mine today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me identify what needs attention
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.77,0:12:25.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,first and give it
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the care it deserves.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am tempted to hurry
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,through something important,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to slow down
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough to do it well.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am polishing
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,something unnecessarily,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.41,0:12:40.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me recognize what is sufficient.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.54,0:12:43.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me to take a needed break,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,honor reasonable limits,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.96,0:12:46.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for help before
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.78,0:12:49.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,exhaustion becomes resentment.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my work serve real people,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.86,0:12:54.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and keep my ambition accountable
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.43,0:12:56.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to love and integrity.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.50,0:12:59.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Fear thou not;
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am with thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be not dismayed;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am thy God:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will strengthen thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea, I will help thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.16,0:13:10.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will uphold thee with the right
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}hand of my righteousness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.13,0:13:16.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive these words as an invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.59,0:13:22.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,to lean on your faithfulness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.27,0:13:24.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize support when
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.60,0:13:27.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,it arrives in ordinary forms:
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,wise advice, shared work,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.25,0:13:30.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,a patient friend,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.69,0:13:32.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the opportunity to ask
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.81,0:13:34.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,a clearer question.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.71,0:13:37.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me humility to accept help without
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.74,0:13:40.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,making my need a source of shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.60,0:13:41.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the challenge
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.86,0:13:43.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still feels heavy,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.56,0:13:45.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide me toward the next
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,appropriate resource.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you both my hope
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.04,0:13:50.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my uncertainty,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,trusting that I can speak honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.16,0:13:56.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,while seeking the strength to continue.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.50,0:13:59.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose the first doorway you will
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.92,0:14:01.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,enter after this prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.98,0:14:03.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before crossing it,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,pause and pray:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, prepare my feet for peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then greet the first person
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,you meet with deliberate kindness,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.23,0:14:14.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,giving them your attention
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.07,0:14:16.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,before making a request.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you are alone,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,use that same pause before
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,your first message.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.53,0:14:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is your commitment for the morning:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.64,0:14:27.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,one threshold, one brief prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.15,0:14:29.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,one considerate beginning.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.69,0:14:31.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.16,0:14:33.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am ready to begin the next
Dialogue: 4,0:14:33.05,0:14:35.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of this morning with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.38,0:14:37.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let truth guide my answers
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and righteousness shape my
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.43,0:14:40.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,private choices.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.97,0:14:42.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Prepare my feet to bring
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace where I enter.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen faith when
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,uncertainty presses close.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.48,0:14:50.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard my mind with the hope
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,of salvation,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let your Word direct my conduct.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me prayerful
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,and attentive to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I stumble,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.57,0:15:01.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,lead me toward repair.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am weary,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me receive support.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.32,0:15:06.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you this day
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.86,0:15:08.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,through Jesus Christ,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.48,0:15:11.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gratitude for the grace to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.13,0:15:15.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,to join this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can write Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also leave a prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.38,0:15:21.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,request in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in our next morning prayer we
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.39,0:15:26.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,will pray over the requests you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you pick up your keys
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,or return to the room around you,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry one part of this prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.65,0:15:35.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,into your first action.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give the honest answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.96,0:15:40.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Enter with a peaceful greeting.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.62,0:15:43.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ask for help with the responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,that feels heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have brought the day before God;
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.75,0:15:50.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,now take the next step with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the words of Scripture remain
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,close as the morning unfolds,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.45,0:15:58.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,guiding your attention back to truth,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,love, and faithful action.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go into your responsibilities
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the hope of Christ beside you.
